    <string name="onb_welcome_title">Welcome to Ebb</string>
    <string name="onb_welcome_body">When you open an app you chose, Ebb asks how long you need. When time is up, the app rests for a while, and there\'s a daily limit too.</string>
    <string name="onb_welcome_honest">Ebb is designed to be hard to remove. That\'s the point.</string>
    <string name="onb_apps_title">Which apps pull you in?</string>
    <string name="onb_apps_body">Pick the apps you want to use on purpose.</string>
    <string name="onb_tiers_title">Session lengths</string>
    <string name="onb_tiers_body">Each time you open a watched app, you pick one of these. The longer the session, the longer the rest after it. You can tune each app later.</string>
    <string name="onb_passes_title">Emergency passes</string>
    <string name="onb_passes_body">For real emergencies: a pass opens a locked app for 10 minutes after a 1-minute wait. Each use is logged and resets your streak.</string>
    <string name="onb_admin_title">Uninstall protection</string>
    <string name="onb_admin_body">Device admin stops Ebb from being uninstalled on impulse. Ebb asks for no admin powers: it can\'t lock, wipe or watch your phone.</string>
